title: 'HRMP: let a migration hand its deposits to `pallet-hrmp-para`'
doc:
- audience: Runtime Dev
  description: |-
    Replace `ReceiveMigratedChannels` with `ReceiveMigratedDeposits`: the migration trait now hands
    over the deposit of one side of a channel.
    Implement `ReceiveMigratedDeposits` on `pallet-hrmp-para`, for the AHMv2 migration.

crates:
- name: pallet-hrmp-para
  bump: major
- name: hrmp-primitives
  bump: major
